OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum to close ahead of
OL,4,A'remarkable' exhibit opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum is closing for repair work
OL,7,Fahead of an exhibit of the
OL,8,Fhighest-value treasure ever found in
OL,9,Fthe UK opening.
OL,11,FThe Museum of Somerset in Taunton will
OL,12,Fdisplay in 2027 a hoard of 2,584 silver
OL,13,Fpennies from the time of the Norman
OL,14,Fconquest, which was found in Chew
OL,15,FValley in 2019.
OL,17,FMuseum chiefs said the temporary
OL,18,Fclosure will allow "vital conservation
OL,19,Fand improvements works to take place"
OL,20,Fto safeguard the building ahead of the
OL,21,Fexhibit opening.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
