OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum to close ahead of
OL,4,A'remarkable' exhibit opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam Astill, South West Heritage Trust
OL,7,Fchief executive, said: "These works are
OL,8,Fessential to protecting one of
OL,9,FSomerset's most important historic
OL,10,Fbuildings and the remarkable
OL,11,Fcollections it houses."
